OL,3,GNEWSAFootball campaign urges mental
OL,4,Ahealth help
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans are being encouraged to
OL,7,Fseek early help if they are struggling
OL,8,Fwith their mental health.
OL,10,FHartlepool United has teamed up with
OL,11,Fthe Tees, Esk and Wear Valleys NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust (TEWV) to launch the
OL,13,FPoolies Matter initiative focusing on
OL,14,Fmental health.
OL,16,FLed by the trust, it offers practical
OL,17,Fhelp for those experiencing anxiety,
OL,18,Floneliness or depression and features
OL,19,Freal stories from Pools supporters and
OL,20,Fcommunity groups to encourage others to
OL,21,Fask for help.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
